        "titleHTML": "Add multi-source notification grouping with sticky headers",
        "bodyHTML": "<h2>Summary</h2><p>Groups notifications by source in the inbox view, with sticky section headers that follow the scroll. Solves the &quot;wall of items&quot; problem we keep hitting on Mondays.</p><h2>Changes</h2><ul><li>New <code>NotificationGroup</code> component with collapsible sections per integration.</li><li>Sticky header behavior using <code>position: sticky</code> and a small intersection observer to fade the divider.</li><li>Persisted collapse state per source in <code>localStorage</code>.</li></ul><h2>Notes for reviewers</h2><blockquote><p>Pay attention to the focus order when sections collapse — I think it's right but a fresh pair of eyes would help.</p></blockquote>",
